Link picotls into picohttp-core once.

picohttp-core listed ${PTLS_LIBRARIES} as a PRIVATE link dependency while also
linking picoquic-core PUBLIC, and picoquic-core already carries
${PTLS_LIBRARIES} PUBLIC. Every picohttp-core link therefore named each picotls
archive twice, which Apple's linker reports as "ignoring duplicate libraries"
when building libpicohttp-core as a shared library. picohttp-core still gets
picotls from picoquic-core's public interface, so the private entry is dropped.

Applies to picoquic 55b473e207e436d06ea9a2895cc1fc555d42c81c.

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -539,7 +539,6 @@
     add_library(picoquic::picohttp-core ALIAS picohttp-core)
     target_link_libraries(picohttp-core
         PRIVATE
-            ${PTLS_LIBRARIES}
             ${OPENSSL_LIBRARIES}
             ${MBEDTLS_LIBRARIES}
         PUBLIC
